145 - Songs of Thankfulness and Praise
 / 
Key: G
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 145
Topic: Jesus Christ - 

Verse 1:
[G]Songs of [C/G]thankfulness [G]and [F#dim]praise,
[G]Jesus, Lord, to [C/G]You we [D/F#]raise,
[G]Manifested [C]by [Em/B]the star
[Em/G]To [G]the sages [Em/B]from [G]afar;
[G]Branch of royal [C/G]David's [D/F#]stem
[G]In [C]Your [Em/B]birth [G/D]at [Bm]Bethlehem;
[Am/E]Anthems be [Bm]to You [D7/C]addressed,
[Am]God in [C/G]man [Bm/F#]made [Am/E]manifested.

Verse 2:
[G]Manifest [D/F#]at [G]Jordan's [F#dim]stream,
[G]Prophet's, Priest, and [C/G]King supreme;
[G]And at Cana, [C]wedding [Em/B]guest,
[Em/G]In [G]Your Godhead [Em/B]manifest;
[G]Manifest in [C/G]power [D/F#]divine,
[G]Changing [Em/B]water [Bm]into [G/D]wine;
[Am/E]Anthems be [Bm]to You [D7/C]addressed,
[Am]God in [C/G]man [Bm/F#]made [Am/E]manifested.

Verse 3:
[G]Manifest [C/G]in [D/F#]making [G]whole
[G]Palsied limbs and [C/G]fainting [D/F#]soul;
[G]Manifest [C]in valliant [Em/B]fight,
[Em/G]Quelling [G]all [D/A]the [Em/B]devil's [G]might;
[G]Manifest in [C/G]gracious [D/F#]will,
[G]Ever [Em/B]bringing [Bm]good [C]from [G/D]ill;
[Am/E]Anthems be [Bm]to You [D7/C]addressed,
[Am]God in [C/G]man [Bm/F#]made [Am/E]manifested.

Verse 4:
[G]Grant us [C/G]grace [D/F#]to [G]see You, [F#dim]Lord,
[G]Mirrored in Your [C/G]holy [D/F#]Word;
[G]May we imitate [Em/B]Your way,
[Em/G]And [G]be pure, [D/A]as [Em/B]pure [G]we may,
[G]That we like to [C/G]You may [D/F#]be
[G]At [C]Your [Em/B]great [G/D]epiphany;
[Am/E]Let us praise [Bm]You, ever [D7/C]blest,
[Am]God [C/G]in [Bm/F#]man [Am/E]made [G]manifest.
